  "id": "library",
  "title": "Lost in the Library",
  "theme": "castle",
  "start": "library",
  "intro": "You fell asleep over a book, and when you woke up the Hartwell Library was dark and locked. Mrs Hartwell, the librarian, always said the way out is written in the books. Tonight you will have to find out which ones.",
  "winTitle": "Out of the reading room",
  "winText": "The iron key turns and the old oak door creaks open. Beyond it a narrow stair leads down to the archive, and somewhere below a lamp is still burning. Room one: done.",
